<title>ITALY: Italian total bank lending rose 2.1 pct in Nov.</title>
<headline>Italian total bank lending rose 2.1 pct in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total bank lending in Italy rose 2.1 percent year-on-year in November compared with a 2.3 percent rise in October, the Bank of Italy said in a statement on Friday.</p>
</text>
